{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "start",
  "kind": "flow",
  "uis": [
    "hub"
  ],
  "commands": [
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "greet",
      "params": [
        "who"
      ],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "say",
          "text": "{who}，欢迎来到灵泛！",
          "speaker": "{who}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "moodAngry",
      "params": [],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "style",
          "target": "lingfan",
          "props": {
            "source": "Images/角色/灵泛_愤怒.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "moodNeutral",
      "params": [],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "style",
          "target": "lingfan",
          "props": {
            "source": "Images/角色/灵泛_正面.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "moodSerious",
      "params": [],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "style",
          "target": "lingfan",
          "props": {
            "source": "Images/角色/灵泛_严肃.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "moodShy",
      "params": [],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "style",
          "target": "lingfan",
          "props": {
            "source": "Images/角色/灵泛_娇羞.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "moodThinking",
      "params": [],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "style",
          "target": "lingfan",
          "props": {
            "source": "Images/角色/灵泛_手托下巴_疑问.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "portraitNeutral",
      "params": [],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "hide",
          "target": "lingfan"
        },
        {
          "op": "show",
          "target": "Images/角色/灵泛_正面.png",
          "id": "lingfan",
          "x": 860,
          "y": 110,
          "background": false
        },
        {
          "op": "style",
          "target": "lingfan",
          "props": {
            "width": 360,
            "height": 560,
            "stretch": "contain"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "character",
      "key": "灵泛",
      "name": "灵泛",
      "color": "#7aa2f7"
    },
    {
      "op": "background",
      "resource": "Images/hall.svg"
    },
    {
      "op": "call",
      "target": "portraitNeutral",
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "op": "style",
      "target": "lingfan",
      "props": {
        "opacity": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "animate",
      "target": "lingfan",
      "property": "opacity",
      "value": 1,
      "duration": 1.2,
      "easing": "EaseOutQuad"
    },
    {
      "op": "bgm",
      "resource": "Audio/bgm_theme.wav",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "fade": 1500,
      "loop": true
    },
    {
      "op": "ambient",
      "resource": "Audio/crickets_night01.mp3",
      "volume": 0.35,
      "fade": 1200,
      "loop": true
    },
    {
      "op": "mount",
      "name": "hub",
      "visible": true,
      "props": {
        "label": "进度",
        "value": "序幕"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "key": "player.sex",
      "value": "male"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "夜风穿过大厅，灯火摇曳。灯影里，一个身影向你走来。"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "旅人，你终于到了。我是灵泛，这台引擎的引路人。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "这里的一草一木、一声一息，都由命令与状态织成——且听我慢慢道来。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "call",
      "target": "moodThinking",
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "op": "input",
      "prompt": "旅人，报上名来：",
      "store": "player.name"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "key": "player.gold",
      "value": "+= {20}"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "cond": "{player.gold >= 25}",
      "then": [
        {
          "op": "call",
          "target": "moodShy",
          "args": []
        },
        {
          "op": "notify",
          "text": "金币充足！当前 {player.gold} 枚。",
          "type": "info"
        },
        {
          "op": "call",
          "target": "greet",
          "args": [
            "{player.name}"
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "call",
          "target": "moodNeutral",
          "args": []
        }
      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "op": "call",
          "target": "moodAngry",
          "args": []
        },
        {
          "op": "say",
          "text": "囊中羞涩……先去赚点钱吧。"
        },
        {
          "op": "call",
          "target": "moodNeutral",
          "args": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "这是给你的盘缠：{player.gold:000} 枚金币（插值 + 补零格式化）。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "富文本也能入戏：{b}加粗{/b}、{i}斜体{/i}、{u}下划线{/u}、{color=#FFD700}金色{/color}、{color=#9ece6a}{size=22}大字{/size}{/color}。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "se",
      "resource": "Audio/se_ui_confirm.wav",
      "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
      "op": "call",
      "target": "moodSerious",
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "op": "nvl",
      "mode": "enter"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "灵泛：这台引擎以状态为唯一事实源，命令驱动一切呈现。"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "灵泛：对话、立绘、音频、选择，皆是可回溯、可存档的数据。"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "灵泛：愿你在此看见引擎的全貌，也看见故事的温柔。"
    },
    {
      "op": "nvl",
      "mode": "exit"
    },
    {
      "op": "call",
      "target": "moodNeutral",
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "让我为你放一段世界的剪影。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "cutscene",
      "resource": "Video/m1.mp4",
      "volume": 0.8,
      "skipable": true,
      "z": 1450
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "过场结束——播完或点击跳过都会继续。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "seconds": 1,
      "skipable": true
    },
    {
      "op": "se",
      "resource": "Audio/se_whoosh.wav",
      "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
      "op": "guard",
      "fn": "gold-non-negative"
    },
    {
      "op": "call",
      "target": "moodThinking",
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "op": "menu",
      "prompt": "接下来去哪里？",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "酒馆",
          "target": "inn"
        },
        {
          "text": "广场",
          "target": "square"
        },
        {
          "text": "元素舞台",
          "target": "stage_demo"
        },
        {
          "text": "TS 能力",
          "target": "ts_power"
        },
        {
          "text": "功能演示",
          "target": "feat_hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "词汇全席",
          "target": "tour"
        },
        {
          "text": "沙盒地图（沙盒 demo）",
          "target": "world"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
